---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const site = Astro.site ?? new URL('https://uncrashableholdings.com');
const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: site.toString() },
  { name: 'Start Here', url: new URL('/start-here', site).toString() },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Start Here"
  description="An orientation guide for anyone arriving from a conversation, a workshop, or a referral, walking through Invisible Fragility, AOIDR, the diagnostics, and Continuity Architecture in order."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <h1>Start Here</h1>
  <p>
    If you found this site through a conversation, a workshop, or someone else's mention of it, and you're not sure where to begin, start here.
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Understand the problem. <a href="/framework/invisible-fragility">Invisible Fragility</a> names the condition that makes stable things quietly vulnerable.
    </li>
    <li>
      Learn the framework. <a href="/framework/aoidr">AOIDR</a> breaks continuity into five examinable pillars: Authority, Ownership, Income, Documentation, Resilience.
    </li>
    <li>
      See how it's examined. The <a href="/diagnostics">diagnostics</a> move from a five-question <a href="/diagnostics/continuity-scan">Continuity Scan</a>, to a full <a href="/diagnostics/ifi">Invisible Fragility Index</a>, to a <a href="/diagnostics/continuity-stress-test">Continuity Stress Test</a>, depending on how deep the question requires.
    </li>
    <li>
      Redesign the structure. <a href="/continuity-architecture">Continuity Architecture</a> is what gets built once a diagnostic reveals something worth addressing.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Ready to look at your own situation? Take the Invisible Fragility Index written for your
    <a href="https://tally.so/r/vG1xeD" rel="noopener">household</a>,
    <a href="https://tally.so/r/7Rz9R0" rel="noopener">business</a>, or
    <a href="https://tally.so/r/A7yMVy" rel="noopener">nonprofit</a>.
  </p>
  <p>There is no wrong place to enter. There is only a better place to begin.</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  ol { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
</style>
